    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the absurd world of the parody horror game \u201cYetiParty.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an unmatched walking simulator set in a Russian village (now with a pinch of realism!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pick up items and carry them in your hands \u2014 <i>revolutionary gameplay</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some assets you've definitely never seen in other games (but let\u2019s be honest \u2014 you probably have).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Unreal Engine 5, which, surprisingly, didn\u2019t improve the quality at all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.poster.avif?t=1755776465\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.webm?t=1755776465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.mp4?t=1755776465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a first-year student named Pyodor.\u00a0His parents couldn\u2019t choose between Fyodor and Pyotr, so they went with a compromise. To celebrate getting into university, Pyodor and his friends head to a remote Russian village to party.\u00a0But things take a turn when an ancient evil awakens deep in the forest\u2026 Oh, and three local thugs really want to steal your phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/1dd3c6bcef5fd639f0bbfc371a86a0cd.poster.avif?t=1755776465\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/1dd3c6bcef5fd639f0bbfc371a86a0cd.webm?t=1755776465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/1dd3c6bcef5fd639f0bbfc371a86a0cd.mp4?t=1755776465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Feed the rabbits, grab some beers, and maybe try to lose your virginity to your friend\u2019s hot sister.\u00a0Otherwise, a bloodthirsty Yeti might mount you on his hairy\u2026 you know what.\u00a0So party hard \u2014 before night falls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/943ca5798f1bcff78e3a05f6a526aad3.poster.avif?t=1755776465\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/943ca5798f1bcff78e3a05f6a526aad3.webm?t=1755776465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/943ca5798f1bcff78e3a05f6a526aad3.mp4?t=1755776465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<i>Yes, it\u2019s actually... special.</i>)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-effort jokes and filthy punchlines written by wannabe Tarantinos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cutting-edge dialogue system that affects absolutely nothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll laugh. You'll scream. It\u2019s like two games for the price of one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient memes, loud profanity, and proudly dumb stereotypes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer soundtrack featuring such legendary hits as:<br><i>\u201cAnd the Cranes Flew Over the River Outpost\u201d</i><br><i>\u201cMy Python Is Ready for Love\u201d</i><br><i>\u201c18 Seconds of Passion\u201d</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/89a329d86fb48afc18eff385255973bf.poster.avif?t=1755776465\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/89a329d86fb48afc18eff385255973bf.webm?t=1755776465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/89a329d86fb48afc18eff385255973bf.mp4?t=1755776465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a bonus, the game also includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Cringe-worthy Russian voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Plot twists straight out of <i>DuckTales</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) A chance to fix Uncle Kolya\u2019s car (whoever the hell that is).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) A good ol\u2019 punch in the face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But the most important thing is the story that <i>YetiParty</i> has to offer.</strong><br><br><br><strong>A coming-of-age tale. A story of love. A story of life itself...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are we kidding \u2014 it\u2019s pure chaos and unfiltered degeneracy!<br>You\u2019ve been warned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game lasts approximately 60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the absurd world of the parody horror game \u201cYetiParty.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an unmatched walking simulator set in a Russian village (now with a pinch of realism!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pick up items and carry them in your hands \u2014 <i>revolutionary gameplay</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some assets you've definitely never seen in other games (but let\u2019s be honest \u2014 you probably have).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Unreal Engine 5, which, surprisingly, didn\u2019t improve the quality at all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.poster.avif?t=1755776465\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.webm?t=1755776465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823130/extras/888bab25958e20ba0b1dcc9ce71ce98d.mp4?t=1755776465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a first-year student named Pyodor.\u00a0His parents couldn\u2019t choose between Fyodor and Pyotr, so they went with a compromise. To celebrate getting into university, Pyodor and his friends head to a remote Russian village to party.\u00a0But things take a turn when an ancient evil awakens deep in the forest\u2026 Oh, and three local thugs really want to steal your phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 